  "description": "Tae-Beom, a janitor at Korea University, uses his outstanding looks and sympathy detection skills to work as a self-proclaimed 'Korea University sympathy killer'. Tae-Beom, who boasts a 100% success rate as a sympathy killer, meets Chae-Yi, a sympathy from Cheongdam University that's perfect for his taste, and as usual, tries to take his sympathy with his own hands, but he says \"I don't know..! I'm married!!!\" What's that XX..? If he had tried something properly, it wouldn't have been so unfair. He has met a formidable enemy of a new type!!! Will Tae-Beom be able to find Chae-Yi who has been hiding and accomplish his mission as a sympathy killer??\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
